- **Correlation/dispersion:** Avg pairwise 60d correlation 0.166 (low); cross-sectional daily dispersion ~1.97%. Healthy environment for cross-asset dispersion factors.
- **Drawdown context:** Deep 250d drawdowns in crypto (ETH −67.6%, BTC −52.5%), WTI −55.9%, CN10Y −51.0%, 000688 −43.2% — momentum signals in beaten-down assets may whipsaw.

